title: OpenAI Platform: Organization costs
agents: openai_platform
catalog: app
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-openai extension
description: Shows provider-reported organization cost for today, previous day and month-to-date. No spend thresholds are hard-coded. Optional upper thresholds are configured in the OpenAI Platform organization policy. Usage/cost documentation: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10478918-reviewing-api-usage-and-costs.
discovery: One service is created whenever cost data collection is enabled and available.
